 formulation of topical corticosteroid prescribed. \n\u2022 Determined by child\u2019s age, eczema severity and affected site(s). \n\u2022 Wrong base of topical steroid - creams will sting open skin, but ointments are too greasy for \nolder patients and hair bearing areas and can cause miliaria if used in very hot \nenvironments.", "type": "Document"}}